  "title": "Honda Signs Agreement with GAC Group to Extend Term of GAC Honda Joint Venture",
  "summary": "Honda Global | Honda Motor (China) Investment Co., Ltd. (HMCI), a wholly-owned Honda subsidiary in China, today announced that Honda and its automobile production and sales joint venture partner in China, Guangzhou Automobile Group Co., Ltd. (GAC Group), signed an agreement to extend the joint venture term of GAC Honda Automobile Co., Ltd. (GAC Honda) through 2038.",
